  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-18T03:47:14.097446Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-18T12:07:08.769406Z",
  "totalBlocks": 137,
  "translatedBlocks": 132,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "48f3b81ec0f488fc",
      "translationZh": "在不断演进的编程与软件开发领域，对效率和生产力的追求催生了诸多引人注目的创新。其中一项创新便是 Codex、StarCoder 和 Code Llama 等代码生成模型的出现。这些模型在生成类似人类编写的代码片段方面展现出了卓越的能力，由此显现出作为编程助手的巨大潜力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49f69567a8663c78",
      "translationZh": "然而，尽管这些预训练模型在各种任务中都能表现出色，但还有一种令人兴奋的可能性即将成为现实：根据你的具体需求定制代码生成模型。想象一下，能够在企业规模上应用的个性化编程助手。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca67b70afbb35d59",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博文中，我们将展示如何创建 HugCoder 🤗，这是一个基于 huggingface GitHub 组织的公开仓库中的代码内容进行微调的代码大语言模型。我们将讨论数据收集工作流程、训练实验以及一些有趣的结果。这将使你能够基于自己的专有代码库创建个人编程助手。最后，我们还会提出这个项目的几个进一步扩展方向，供你开展实验。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c253a8d0b8c938be",
      "translationZh": "让我们开始吧 🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e2e8e37c5c5d9904",
      "translationZh": "数据收集工作流程",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "eda5ab712b7dbeff",
      "translationZh": "我们想要的数据集在概念上很简单，我们将其组织为如下结构：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8726643dc521f784",
      "translationZh": "仓库名称",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35b02ac4bf1a092e",
      "translationZh": "仓库中的文件路径",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4112a488690bdbc1",
      "translationZh": "文件内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "291fcd6c924bf95f",
      "translationZh": "使用 Python GitHub API 抓取 GitHub 上的代码内容很简单。不过，根据仓库数量以及每个仓库中的代码文件数量，很容易遇到 API 速率限制问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f43e560f4faa6517",
      "translationZh": "为避免此类问题，我们决定将所有公开仓库克隆到本地，直接从中提取内容，而不是通过 API 获取。我们使用 Python 的 multiprocessing 模块并行下载所有仓库，具体如这个下载脚本所示。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4975f88a5e5bffc6",
      "translationZh": "仓库中往往包含图像、演示文稿和其他资源等非代码文件。我们不打算抓取这些文件，因此创建了一份扩展名列表，将它们过滤掉。对于 Jupyter Notebooks 以外的代码文件，我们直接使用 \"utf-8\" 编码进行解析。对于笔记本，我们只处理代码单元格。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61b9af5f879c3d4f",
      "translationZh": "我们还排除了所有与代码无直接关系的文件路径，包括：.git、__pycache__ 和 xcodeproj。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f98e2c605e0f73fe",
      "translationZh": "为了让这些内容的序列化过程相对节省内存，我们采用了分块处理和 feather 格式。完整实现请参阅这个脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "615c4a3873799cb2",
      "translationZh": "最终数据集已在 Hub 上提供，如下所示：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3ed8e9d929b67ef7",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客中，我们选取了 Hugging Face 按加星用户数排名前 10 的公开仓库。它们分别是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bd31344795c5603",
      "translationZh": "这是我们用于生成该数据集的代码，这是 Hub 上的数据集。下面是它的一个快照：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "676e6c6ca658a48a",
      "translationZh": "为了降低项目复杂度，我们没有考虑对数据集进行去重。如果你有兴趣在生产应用中采用去重技术，这篇博文是一份很好的参考资料，探讨了代码 LLM 场景下的这一主题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a32dd6479d0e3892",
      "translationZh": "微调你自己的个人编程助手",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe52e6dec5ed732c",
      "translationZh": "在本节中，我们将展示如何微调以下模型：bigcode/starcoder（15.5B 参数）、bigcode/starcoderbase-1b（1B 参数）、Deci/DeciCoder-1b（1B 参数）。所有实验都将在配备单张 A100 40GB 的 Colab Notebook 中使用 🤗 PEFT（参数高效微调）进行。此外，我们还将展示如何利用 🤗 Accelerate 的 FSDP 集成，在一台配备 8 张 A100 80GB GPU 的机器上对 bigcode/starcoder（15.5B 参数）进行全量微调。训练目标是中间填充（FIM），即将训练序列中的部分内容移至末尾，并以自回归方式预测重新排序后的序列。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "86da0ee1410a7a54",
      "translationZh": "为什么使用 PEFT？全量微调成本高昂。我们来看一些数字，以便更直观地理解：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19f5782c8a820b53",
      "translationZh": "全量微调所需的最低 GPU 显存：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "015642511d850280",
      "translationZh": "权重：2 字节（混合精度训练）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "82d58fd7daf2ce94",
      "translationZh": "权重梯度：2 字节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e450b3f357cd7dc6",
      "translationZh": "使用 Adam 时的优化器状态：原始 FP32 权重占 4 字节，一阶和二阶矩估计占 8 字节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1da58a47b191dbbe",
      "translationZh": "将上述各项相加后的每参数开销：每个参数 16 字节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0cbe53280e419c63",
      "translationZh": "15.5B 模型 -> 248GB GPU 显存，这甚至还未考虑存储中间激活值所需的大量显存 -> 至少需要 4 张 A100 80GB GPU",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baad9f6b5c17e49c",
      "translationZh": "由于硬件需求巨大，我们将使用 QLoRA 进行参数高效微调。以下是使用 QLoRA 微调 StarCoder 的最低 GPU 显存需求：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "acadc89f213eeb8e",
      "translationZh": "可训练参数：110,428,160 || 全部参数：15,627,884,544 || 可训练参数占比：0.7066097761926236",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "078dc17011542f40",
      "translationZh": "基础模型权重：0.5 字节 * 15.51B 冻结参数 = 7.755 GB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a4fd9f3de9fedc05",
      "translationZh": "适配器权重：2 字节 * 0.11B 可训练参数 = 0.22GB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "09383a15de017f2a",
      "translationZh": "权重梯度：2 字节 * 0.11B 可训练参数 = 0.12GB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6867ac78c12a89fc",
      "translationZh": "使用 Adam 时的优化器状态：4 字节 * 0.11B 可训练参数 * 3 = 1.32GB",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b357205b4f5b846b",
      "translationZh": "将以上各项相加 -> 9.51 GB ~10GB -> 需要 1 块 A100 40GB GPU 🤯。之所以需要 A100 40GB GPU，是因为训练时，2048 的长序列长度和 4 的批次大小所产生的中间激活值会带来更高的显存需求。如下文所示，所需的 GPU 显存为 26GB，A100 40GB GPU 可以容纳。此外，A100 GPU 与 Flash Attention 2 的兼容性更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "22a38bc69dad8ef7",
      "translationZh": "在上述计算中，我们没有考虑中间激活检查点所需的显存，这部分显存需求相当大。我们利用 Flash Attention V2 和梯度检查点来解决这个问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "053c9845001c6df1",
      "translationZh": "对于 QLoRA，配合 flash attention V2 和梯度检查点，在批次大小为 4 时，模型在单块 A100 40GB GPU 上总共占用 26 GB 显存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9a20d7c467bf8e8a",
      "translationZh": "对于使用 FSDP 并配合 Flash Attention V2 和梯度检查点的全量微调，在 per_gpu_batch_size 为 1 时，每块 GPU 的显存占用介于 70 GB 和 77.6 GB 之间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e39aa6d3e88fb6e9",
      "translationZh": "请参阅 model-memory-usage，以便轻松计算训练托管在 🤗 Hugging Face Hub 上的模型以及对其执行大模型推理所需的 vRAM。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fee6d996be24b9b7",
      "translationZh": "全量微调",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "44232c72e3bcdbc8",
      "translationZh": "我们将介绍如何使用 PyTorch 完全分片数据并行（FSDP）技术，在 8 张 A100 80GB GPU 上对 bigcode/starcoder（15B 参数）进行全量微调。有关 FSDP 的更多信息，请参阅《使用 PyTorch FSDP 微调 Llama 2 70B》和《使用 PyTorch 完全分片数据并行加速大模型训练》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e89b30aa1dc30a6a",
      "translationZh": "资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "324179f4ede28b53",
      "translationZh": "代码库：链接。它使用了 Transformers 最近新增的 Flash Attention V2 支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bb7a3ca1d5854fc6",
      "translationZh": "FSDP 配置：fsdp_config.yaml",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "638c678aaa94e945",
      "translationZh": "模型：bigcode/stacoder",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c13f90b8d41d24ed",
      "translationZh": "数据集：smangrul/hf-stack-v1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e74cef590ea2b221",
      "translationZh": "微调后的模型：smangrul/peft-lora-starcoder15B-v2-personal-copilot-A100-40GB-colab",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "06de257eb041530c",
      "translationZh": "启动训练的命令见 run_fsdp.sh。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "431cd2b31cb9acf7",
      "translationZh": "总训练时间为 9 小时。按照 lambdalabs 上 8x A100 80GB GPU 每小时 $12.00 的费用计算，总成本为 $108。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbda713174a435f1",
      "translationZh": "我们将介绍如何使用 🤗 PEFT，在单张 A100 40GB GPU 上通过 QLoRA 对 bigcode/starcoder（15B 参数）进行微调。有关 QLoRA 和 PEFT 方法的更多信息，请参阅《借助 bitsandbytes、4 位量化和 QLoRA，让大语言模型更加触手可及》以及《🤗 PEFT：在低资源硬件上对数十亿参数规模的模型进行参数高效微调》。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e89b30aa1dc30a6a",
      "translationZh": "资源",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "324179f4ede28b53",
      "translationZh": "代码库：链接。它使用了 Transformers 最近新增的 Flash Attention V2 支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a43ee4f84c18fee3",
      "translationZh": "Colab 笔记本：链接。请务必选择 A100 GPU，并启用高 RAM 设置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "638c678aaa94e945",
      "translationZh": "模型：bigcode/stacoder",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c13f90b8d41d24ed",
      "translationZh": "数据集：smangrul/hf-stack-v1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "da2a24bbef165ca1",
      "translationZh": "QLoRA 微调模型：smangrul/peft-lora-starcoder15B-v2-personal-copilot-A100-40GB-colab",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "899e17c87aa2039a",
      "translationZh": "启动训练的命令见 run_peft.sh。总训练时间为 12.5 小时。按 lambdalabs 的每小时 $1.10 计算，总成本为 $13.75。这相当不错 🚀！从成本来看，仅为全量微调成本的 1/7.8。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "571527339d0e3e34",
      "translationZh": "比较",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a98efc2491a5994",
      "translationZh": "下图展示了 QLoRA 与全量微调的评估损失、训练损失和学习率调度情况。我们观察到，与 QLoRA 相比，全量微调的损失略低，收敛也稍快一些。peft 微调的学习率是全量微调的 10 倍。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb618151b1f81265",
      "translationZh": "为确保我们的 QLoRA 模型不会出现灾难性遗忘，我们对其运行了 Python Human Eval 评估。以下是我们得到的结果。Pass@1 衡量的是每道题仅考虑一个生成代码候选答案时，补全结果的通过率。我们可以看到，基础模型 bigcode/starcoder（15B 参数）与微调后的 PEFT 模型 smangrul/peft-lora-starcoder15B-v2-personal-copilot-A100-40GB-colab 在 humaneval-python 上的表现相当。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2c614c23f02239",
      "translationZh": "模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "132a597d6c173864",
      "translationZh": "现在来看一些定性样例。在人工分析中，我们注意到 QLoRA 导致了轻微的过拟合，因此我们通过 PEFT 的 add_weighted_adapter 工具创建了一个权重为 0.8 的新加权适配器，以降低其权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "336f8885143d3490",
      "translationZh": "我们将查看 2 个代码中间填充示例，其中模型的任务是填充 <FILL_ME> 占位符所标示的部分。我们将考察 GitHub Copilot、经过 QLoRA 微调的模型以及经过全量微调的模型给出的填充补全结果。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e63d53116b9a711a",
      "translationZh": "定性示例 1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c3633f7e9759a26",
      "translationZh": "在上面的示例中，GitHub Copilot 给出的补全方向是正确的，但帮助不大。相比之下，QLoRA 和全量微调模型的补全结果都正确地填充了整个函数调用，并包含必要的参数。不过，它们随后也添加了大量噪声。这可以通过后处理步骤来控制，将补全内容限制在闭括号或换行符处结束。请注意，QLoRA 和全量微调模型生成的结果质量相近。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4b5f8d7b1871559a",
      "translationZh": "定性示例 2",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4642f5e6df2b9b6b",
      "translationZh": "在上面的第二个示例中，GitHub Copilot 没有给出任何补全。这可能是因为 🤗 PEFT 是一个较新的库，尚未包含在 Copilot 的训练数据中，而这正是我们试图解决的那类问题。相比之下，QLoRA 和全量微调模型的补全结果都正确地填充了整个函数调用，并包含必要的参数。再次注意，QLoRA 和全量微调模型给出的生成结果质量相近。包含各种示例的全量微调模型和 peft 模型推理代码，分别可在 Full_Finetuned_StarCoder_Inference.ipynb 和 PEFT_StarCoder_Inference.ipynb 中找到。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7644e23541b96f9a",
      "translationZh": "因此，我们可以看到，这两种变体的生成结果都符合预期。太棒了！🚀",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
