      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "877beabc423f3ccc",
      "translationZh": "组合多个适配器",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0120",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8267ea8bdb3feef0",
      "translationZh": "现在，让我们看看 code_buddy 在 chatting/question_answering 任务上的表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0121",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02e29ef37c1c1d32",
      "translationZh": "我们可以观察到，code_buddy 的表现比单独使用 assistant 或 copilot 适配器好得多！它能够响应编写代码片段的请求，展示如何使用特定 HF 仓库的 API。不过，它也会产生幻觉，给出错误的链接和解释，这仍然是 LLMs 面临的一项尚未解决的挑战。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0122",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49db11671cc83551",
      "translationZh": "以下是 code_buddy 在代码补全任务上的表现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0123",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7224b77411395fe",
      "translationZh": "我们可以观察到，code_buddy 的表现与专门针对这项任务进行过微调的 copilot 相当。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0124",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bb1c139e68a1d1bf",
      "translationZh": "将 LoRA 迁移到不同的基础模型",
